# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright © 2019, Sviatoslav Sydorenko

# NOTE: Metadata 2.5 support needs packaging 26.1, and twine 7.0
# NOTE: already requires that version or newer itself, so this floor
# NOTE: is currently redundant. It is kept to keep the requirement
# NOTE: explicit, and to guard against a future twine release
# NOTE: declaring a lower bound that is too low for the metadata
# NOTE: version it emits support for, which is what happened with
# NOTE: twine 6.1 and metadata 2.4 below.
# NOTE: Do not write a version specifier for the pinned project into
# NOTE: this comment. Dependabot rewrites any such literal when it
# NOTE: bumps the pin below, which previously left the note stating
# NOTE: a twine requirement that does not exist.
# Ref: https://github.com/pypa/twine/pull/1180
packaging >= 26.3
